WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,850
Mission briefing correct

2
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:05,770
Chengdong Abandoned Assisted Maternity Hospital

3
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,010
For three consecutive weeks, citizens called the police

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:08,010
Witnessing anomalies

5
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,610
Detection based on energy fluctuations in the bureau

6
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:11,890
There will be zero trace of activity there tomorrow night

7
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,770
You went on field trips with Captain Chen Ye's team.

8
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:14,730
This has been since you joined the job

9
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:17,450
The first actual combat assessment, don’t let me down, Vice Captain Lin

10
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:18,730
Stop talking this nonsense

11
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:20,770
I will ask the two most core questions. First:

12
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:21,730
The mission of this broken hospital

13
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,450
It’s extremely difficult to calculate the number. Second

14
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:25,130
If I smooth things over smoothly

15
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:26,610
Thank you for this trip to the field

16
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:32,490
How do you calculate it?

17
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:33,690
I said fat man

18
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,970
Didn't you say you have a special constitution? I'm warning you.

19
00:00:35,970 --> 00:00:37,290
Get off the car later and stay away from me

20
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:39,210
I don't want to be affected by your bad luck.

21
00:00:39,210 --> 00:00:40,610
Vigo, don’t say that.

22
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:42,410
I call it a plot trigger. Follow me.

23
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:43,410
Guaranteed you can encounter big monsters

24
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,450
Obtained the highest level of Captain Chen

25
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:46,970
There's something I need to confirm in advance

26
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:48,450
Our bureau has this kind of late-night field service

27
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:49,410
Is there a late-night snack subsidy?
